[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13566.71, "timestamp": "03:46:06", "text": "嗯，是的，我们需要做音乐。我需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13569.15, "timestamp": "03:46:09", "text": "做我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13571.59, "timestamp": "03:46:11", "text": "家庭作业。问题是我必须接受"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13574.59, "timestamp": "03:46:14", "text": "认真对待这件事。我付了很多钱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13577.51, "timestamp": "03:46:17", "text": "钱不够，而且我也没钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13580.07, "timestamp": "03:46:20", "text": "实践。如果我没有练习，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13582.55, "timestamp": "03:46:22", "text": "我已经没有希望了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13584.95, "timestamp": "03:46:24", "text": "不，我必须继续练习。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13587.349, "timestamp": "03:46:27", "text": "每天这样我才能理解"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13594.59, "timestamp": "03:46:34", "text": "一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13597.67, "timestamp": "03:46:37", "text": "呃，但即使我知道该怎么做，而且我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13605.67, "timestamp": "03:46:45", "text": "呃，确实很糟糕，你知道的。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13609.15, "timestamp": "03:46:49", "text": "坏的。我知道。我为什么插入我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13612.429, "timestamp": "03:46:52", "text": "把专业人士的东西变成我的一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13615.75, "timestamp": "03:46:55", "text": "做。但是，是的，我必须理解这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13619.189, "timestamp": "03:46:59", "text": "就算它很普通很无聊也没关系。"}]